  "name": "Aura Break",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You infuse a target with all the determination and adrenaline of one who is close to death in heated combat, shrouding them in a yellow hue.\nA target affected by this spell can activate a\nLimit Break\nregardless if they are below 50% of their maximum HP. Once a\nLimit Break\nhas been activated while under the effect of Aura Break the spell ends immediately. A creature cannot benefit from this spell more than once per hour.\nThis spell counters and dispels\ncurse\n.\nThis spell was submitted as a part of the SCC for September 2020 by DeadKingKicker.</p>",
